## Decisions and Action Items

1. **Working Group Last Call:** The chairs will initiate an extended Working Group Last Call for `draft-ietf-happy-happyeyeballs-v3` on the mailing list.
2. **Editorial Feedback:** Participants (including Ben Schwartz) will submit specific structural and editorial comments on `draft-ietf-happy-happyeyeballs-v3` during WGLC.
3. **Error Reporting Scope:** The working group will refine the scope of error reporting work on the mailing list, focusing on local logging formats (e.g., QLOG) for an informational document.

